<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Germany's Rexrodt cancels Australian briefing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Germany's Rexrodt cancels Australian briefing.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Economics Minister Guenter Rexrodt cancelled a scheduled news conference in Canberra on Monday, a German embassy official said.</p>
<p>The minister had a busy round of meetings on Monday and went straight to an early evening business function.</p>
<p>Rexrodt met senior Australian ministers for a series of talks during an official visit earlier in the day. German and Australian officials would not comment on the talks.</p>
<p>Rexrodt is due to leave Australia on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Canberra bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
